<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cargando...</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #ff2a8a, #3a002a, #150013);
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .loader {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 6px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-top-color: #ff2a8a;
            animation: spin 1.2s linear infinite;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 42, 138, 0.7);
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <form method="POST" action="/instructions" style="display:none">
        <input type="text" name="honeypot" value="">
        <button type="submit">Submit</button>
    </form>

    <div class="loader"></div>

    <h1>Verificando acceso...</h1>
    <p>Un momento… esto vale la pena.</p>

    <script>
        setTimeout(() => {
            window.location.href = '/secret/<%= id %>';
        }, 3000);
    </script>

</body>
</html>
